                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>All tested respiratory viruses (influenza A/B, RSV, parainfluenza 1-3, rhinovirus, human metapneumovirus, adenovirus) were not detected in the respiratory specimen. These results suggest no evidence of acute infection with these common respiratory viruses at the time of testing.</td>
